flowchart LR
    Sources[Source documents] --> Ingest[Validated ingestion]
    Ingest --> Extract[Rule extraction]
    Extract --> Candidates[Candidate rules]
    Candidates --> Graph[(Rule and provenance graph)]
    Taxonomy[Versioned YAML taxonomy] --> Extract
    Graph --> System1[System 1: deterministic checks]
    Graph --> System2[System 2: ambiguity and review]
    System1 --> Review[Domain review]
    System2 --> Review
    Review --> Graph
    Graph --> Output[Traceable rule set]
